    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fellowship of Infinity is a first-person game involving complex geometry and mathematical puzzles. Experience the void, attain the infinite and observe the indescribable with cosmological symbology. <br>The main objective of this game is to obtain runes, which allow the player to decode hidden messages seen throughout the game. This progression requires levelling up (to a maximum level of 92), obtaining 3 keystones and solving puzzles.\u00a0<br>The secondary objective is to serve as a virtual library for writings made by the developer, Nicholas. These can be accessed from the library or the riemann sphere.<br>Please note: the level 'the lab' is a hidden, developer-only level and public access isn't intended. The final level for public players is 'the ledge'.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fellowship of Infinity is a first-person game involving complex geometry and mathematical puzzles. Experience the void, attain the infinite and observe the indescribable with cosmological symbology. <br>The main objective of this game is to obtain runes, which allow the player to decode hidden messages seen throughout the game. This progression requires levelling up (to a maximum level of 92), obtaining 3 keystones and solving puzzles.\u00a0<br>The secondary objective is to serve as a virtual library for writings made by the developer, Nicholas. These can be accessed from the library or the riemann sphere.<br>Please note: the level 'the lab' is a hidden, developer-only level and public access isn't intended. The final level for public players is 'the ledge'.</p>",
